  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a deep skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and sauté until soft and translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in the garlic, cumin, coriander, and smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the tofu cubes and cook until they start to brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "Pour in the diced tomatoes and chickpeas, then stir to combine.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer gently for 20 minutes until the tofu is silky.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice, salt, and pepper, then adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley before serving over couscous or rice."
